; BOUNCE BONANZA - song 4, course 4: "Moonlit Green" (SPEC.md 128.20)
;
; A minor at 102 BPM with a light SWING - a 16th is 9 then 7 sub-ticks (an
; 8th is always 16, 293 ms), so the 16th pick-ups tiptoe rather than march.
; A nocturne: sneaky, twinkling, never scary.
;
; The intro is the motif hidden in the dark: a glockenspiel picks out its
; notes an octave up between rests, over the organ's pedal and a soft pad,
; and slips down a semitone (F to E) into the theme.
; A is the music box's theme, a period of four patterns: the motif leaps up
; a fourth, twiddles round the harmonic minor's G# - a hiccup of a 16th rest
; in the swing - climbs to C and creeps back down; it answers itself over
; F, half-closes on E, comes again reaching up to E6 (and a D twinkling
; its minor arpeggio over F, an F6 sparkle), and closes on A. Am F | Dm E |
; Am F | Dm E Am, over a pluck bass walking on tiptoe and a strings pad.
; B is the contrast: the recorder in long notes over a plucked harp's lilt
; (4. 8 2) and a held bass - C G | Am D, the D MAJOR the Dorian colour - then
; F G | Bb E, the Phrygian B-flat whose D twinkles on the minor arpeggio
; (a Bbmaj7 shimmer), and E's G# F E (the flat ninth) hands back to A.
; Intro, A1 A2 A3 A4 B1 B2 B3 B4 for ever: 37.5 s a loop.
;
; The speaker hears the lead (q0, so nothing breaks between its notes), the
; kick on one and a tom's rim on three as blips, and - `spkbass` - the bass
; in every rest of the lead: the pedal under the intro's twinkles, a low
; tock in the motif's hiccup, and the bass stepping E B G# into the loop.
;
; Every section's first phrase names its instruments and volumes; the
; phrases after it inherit them, and the loop comes back to A1, which names
; them again.

song moonlit "Moonlit Green"
groove 9 7
unit 16
rows 32
measure 16
spkbass
voice lead glock
voice bass pedal
voice chord stab
; (stab is never heard: every chord phrase names strings or harp itself)

; --- the intro: the motif twinkling in the dark, Am | E ---------------------------
lead LI = q0 o6 e8 r8 o5 a8 r16 g+16 a8 r8 o6 c8 r8 |
          o5 b8 r8 g+8 r8 b8 a8 g+8 f8 |
bass BI = o2 a1 | e1 |
chord CI = @strings v13 o3 [a >c e]1 | [g+ b >e]1 |

; --- A: the music box's theme ------------------------------------------------------
lead LA1 = @musicbox q0 o5 e8 a8 r16 g+16 a8 o6 c8 o5 b8 a8 e8 |
           f8 a8 r16 g16 f8 e8 d8 c8 d8 |
lead LA2 = @musicbox q0 o5 e8 f8 r16 e16 d8 a4 f8 d8 |
           e8 g+8 b8 o6 d8 c8 o5 b8 g+8 r8 |
lead LA3 = @musicbox q0 o5 e8 a8 r16 g+16 a8 o6 c8 e8 d8 c8 |
           o5 a8 o6 c8 r16 o5 b-16 a8 g8 f8 @chiparpm d8 @musicbox c8 |
lead LA4 = @musicbox q0 o5 f8 d8 a8 o6 d8 c8 o5 b8 g+8 e8 |
           a4 r16 e16 a8 o6 c8 o5 b8 a4 |
bass BA1 = @pluckbass o2 a4 e4 a8 b8 o3 c4 | o2 f4 c4 f8 g8 a4 |
bass BA2 = @pluckbass o2 d4 a4 d8 e8 f4 | e4 o1 b4 o2 e8 f8 g+4 |
bass BA4 = @pluckbass o2 d4 f4 e4 g+4 | a4 e4 a8 g8 e8 d8 |
chord CA1 = @strings v13 o3 [a >c e]1 | [a >c f]1 |
chord CA2 = @strings v13 o3 [a >d f]1 | [g+ b >e]1 |
chord CA4 = @strings v13 o3 [a >d f]2 [g+ b >e]2 | [a >c e]1 |
drum DA = k4 h8 h8 T8 h8 h4 | k4 h8 h8 h8 t8 h8 T8 |
drum DA4 = k4 h8 h8 T8 h8 h4 | k4 h8 t8 h8 t8 T8 T8 |

; --- B: the recorder, the harp, Dorian then Phrygian ---------------------------------
lead LB1 = @recorder q0 o5 e4. g8 o6 c4 o5 b8 a8 | b4. a8 g4 d4 |
lead LB2 = @recorder q0 o5 a4 o6 c8 o5 b8 a8 g8 e4 | f+2 e8 f+8 a4 |
lead LB3 = @recorder q0 o6 c2 o5 a8 g8 f8 a8 | g4. f8 d4 f4 |
lead LB4 = @recorder q0 o5 b-4. a8 f4 @chiparpm d4 | @recorder g+4. f8 e4 r4 |
bass BB1 = @bass o2 c2. e4 | o1 g2. b4 |
bass BB2 = @bass o1 a2. o2 c4 | d2. f+4 |
bass BB3 = @bass o2 f2. a4 | g2. b4 |
bass BB4 = @bass o2 b-2. f4 | e2 o1 b4 o2 g+4 |
chord CB1 = @harp v10 o4 [e g >c]4. [e g >c]8 [e g >c]2 | [d g b]4. [d g b]8 [d g b]2 |
chord CB2 = @harp v10 o4 [e a >c]4. [e a >c]8 [e a >c]2 | [d f+ a]4. [d f+ a]8 [d f+ a]2 |
chord CB3 = @harp v10 o4 [f a >c]4. [f a >c]8 [f a >c]2 | [d g b]4. [d g b]8 [d g b]2 |
chord CB4 = @harp v10 o4 [d f b-]4. [d f b-]8 [d f b-]2 | [e g+ b]4. [e g+ b]8 [e g+ b]2 |
drum DB = k4 h4 h4 h8 h8 | k4 h4 h4 h8 T8 |
drum DB4 = k4 h4 h4 h8 h8 | k4 h4 t8 h8 T8 T8 |

order LI  BI  CI  -
order LA1 BA1 CA1 DA          ; 1: the loop comes back here
order LA2 BA2 CA2 DA
order LA3 BA1 CA1 DA
order LA4 BA4 CA4 DA4
order LB1 BB1 CB1 DB
order LB2 BB2 CB2 DB
order LB3 BB3 CB3 DB
order LB4 BB4 CB4 DB4
loop 1
